  <informations>Unofficial simplified front illustration redrawn from official MDT photograph https://www.mdt.de/fileadmin/_processed_/7/b/csm_SCN-MBGRTU-01_MDT_IMG_11_00_4919c4fa61.png. Clear native regular Arial text, not pixel-traced lettering. This is an approximate layout, not a dimensionally/detail-exact manufacturer CAD conversion; pin details omitted. Front nominal envelope 36 x 90 mm, 2 drawing units/mm. No electrical connection terminals. Product source: https://www.mdt.de/produkte/produktdetail/systemkomponenten/systemgeraete/knx-modbus-gateway-rtu485.html</informations>
